Description: testsuite: GtkGLArea's stereo, depth and colour state API
 The defaults, the setters with their notifications, the CICP code points and
 the honest failure of a stereo area on a display that announces no stereo.
 GtkGLArea's color-state defaults to sRGB's colour state, a boxed value: the
 defaultvalue test lists it with the other boxed defaults.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-26
---
